---
title: "split (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_take: take(self.balance, split_amount, ctx)
    q_take --> q_split_balance: balance.split(split_amount)
    q_split_balance --> q_create_coin: new Coin with split balance
    q_create_coin --> [*]: return new_coin

    note right of q_take
        INV-001: self.balance >= split_amount (enforced by balance::split)
        INV-002: self.balance_post + new_coin.balance = self.balance_pre
        INV-003: no supply change - total coins in system unchanged
    end note
